--- GPLv3 组件与本项目许可的关系 / GPLv3 components and this project's license ---

Polaris 采用 mere-aggregation 立场：sing-box 以独立子进程运行、不与 Polaris 链接，
因此 Polaris 自身源码仍以 MIT 发布。**该立场未经检验** —— GNU 官方 FAQ 明确
「什么构成一个作品」是法律问题，最终由法院裁定。本文件不构成法律意见。
出处：https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.html#MereAggregation

Polaris takes the position that shipping sing-box alongside Polaris is mere
aggregation: sing-box runs as a separate process and is not linked into Polaris,
so Polaris's own source stays under the MIT License. This position is untested —
the GNU FAQ states that what counts as "one work" is a legal question that is
ultimately decided by courts. Nothing here is legal advice.
Source: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.html#MereAggregation

sing-box 的完整对应源码（Corresponding Source）在上面的 tag 链接处获取 —— GPLv3 §6
要求在二进制旁给出获取对应源码的明确指引，本段即该指引。Polaris **不自建归档或镜像**，
可获得性依赖上游仓库；若该链接失效，请在本项目 issue 中提出。

The Corresponding Source for the bundled sing-box is the upstream tag linked
above; GPLv3 §6 requires clear directions next to the object code, and this
paragraph is those directions. Polaris keeps no archive or mirror of its own, so
availability depends on the upstream repository. If that link stops working,
